1
00:00:00,018 --> 00:00:04,688
No, no, no, you had your chance to be "we"
for like a year and a half now.

2
00:00:07,192 --> 00:00:09,442
(Leonard:)Right now, you are you,
and you are screwed.

3
00:00:12,114 --> 00:00:15,204
- Why do we have to tell him I did it?
- Not gonna tell him I did it.

4
00:00:15,367 --> 00:00:17,117
(Penny:)Okay, okay, how about this?

5
00:00:17,286 --> 00:00:21,626
(Penny:)We tell him somebody broke in.

6
00:00:23,667 --> 00:00:27,007
(Leonard:)Just to shoot the couch
with a paintball gun?

7
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:30,050
(Penny:)I'm sorry, I buy it.
All those people are on drugs.

8
00:00:30,841 --> 00:00:34,881
(Leonard:)We could tell him they wanted the couch
to stay away from their boyfriend.

9
00:00:36,722 --> 00:00:39,972
(Penny:)Okay, fine.
Well, what if we just flip it over?

10
00:00:41,602 --> 00:00:43,272
(Penny:)There. Looks fine, right?

11
00:00:44,187 --> 00:00:48,107
(Leonard:)Butt print.
There's no discernible butt print.

12
00:00:48,525 --> 00:00:51,445
(Penny:)Oh, come on.

13
00:00:53,739 --> 00:00:54,779
(Penny:)There. Butt print.

14
00:00:55,532 --> 00:00:58,372
(Leonard:)It's too small and too perfect.

15
00:00:59,995 --> 00:01:03,025
(Penny:)- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

